# Experiment 3 — two voices in one pool.
#
# Generation runs once per persona, MAX_NEW split between them, every candidate
# stamped with `persona:`. Nothing in the filename or the body says which voice
# wrote which, so you read the pool exactly as you always do — and what you move
# into Keep/ is the answer. `bin/ab.sh score` counts it.
PERSONAS=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/offline/personas/two-voices.tsv
